pcl:Lineage03 backlog:archivalTrigger "Found achieved and un-archived by backlog_lineage_archive_v2_1_0: mission Out_Achieved, closure report present, every item Done or Cancelled, not frozen. Owner's rule 2026-09-09: an achieved lineage found triggers the archival activity." ;
    backlog:archiveFile "archive/interactive_page_lineage_abox_archive_v1_1_0.ttl" ;
    backlog:archivedAt "2026-11-08T10:33:56+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasLineageStatus backlog:LS_Archived ;
    backlog:lineageArchived true ;
    rdfs:comment "Correction appended 2026-11-08: the archival trigger above is the archive tool's standard text and says the mission was Achieved. It was not: the mission of Lineage 3 is Abandoned, its closure report marked Cancelled, on the Owner's ruling IP-R1 and his confirmation IP-R2. The tool's checks accept an abandoned mission with a closure report; only its text is wrong."@en .

