    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Shrink ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "Owner, 2026-11-04: \"We need to use more human language. This is hard to understand. Additionally, course page is one of the RDODI profiles set to build course pages from the pipeline. We need a default interactive page format. As far as I see, we need to revise the currently active lineage. Let's start the change management ceremony.\" Session's reading, to be confirmed: the course page is what the course-companion profile uses, so it is shown in the profile-to-page map and by one chapter page, and is no longer treated as the template everything is measured against." ;
    backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo pcl:Scope ;
    backlog:supportsObjective pcl:Obj_K1 ;
    rdfs:comment "Owner, 2026-11-04: accepted both change requests and one replacement mission (\"Yes, one mission is rational\"; \"Yes, proceed\"), after proposing that the interactive page needs a stand-alone ontology, organised by kind, which RDODI consumes, built by this lineage and then handed to a new session." .

pcl:CR_DefaultPageFormat a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "RDODI gets one default interactive page format"@en ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage pcl:Lineage02 ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "Owner, 2026-11-04: \"We need to use more human language. This is hard to understand. Additionally, course page is one of the RDODI profiles set to build course pages from the pipeline. We need a default interactive page format. As far as I see, we need to revise the currently active lineage. Let's start the change management ceremony.\" Session's reading, to be confirmed: RDODI needs one default page format that every new interactive page starts from unless its profile names its own, made from the best of what exists (the current default page, the Explorer, the course page's features) and passing the Owner's page rules. This also lifts the exclusion that left the choice of the default template out of this lineage." ;
    backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo pcl:Scope ;
    backlog:supportsObjective pcl:Obj_P1 ;
    rdfs:comment "Owner, 2026-11-04: accepted both change requests and one replacement mission (\"Yes, one mission is rational\"; \"Yes, proceed\"), after proposing that the interactive page needs a stand-alone ontology, organised by kind, which RDODI consumes, built by this lineage and then handed to a new session." .

