pcl:Mission a backlog:Mission ;
    rdfs:label "Mission: the page conditions of RDODI"@en ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:hasMissionOrigin backlog:Origin_SessionDrafted ;
    backlog:hasMissionOutcome backlog:Out_Abandoned ;
    backlog:hasMissionStatement "Make the Owner's page conditions rules that RDODI enforces: RDODI makes the Owner's page conditions gates that every Stage 4 page must pass; has every page template and example it ships meet those conditions; names, for every profile with a generated run, the page it gets and what it requires of that page; and shows the adopted course page working here, with one chapter page built in this package that passes the gates."^^xsd:string ;
    backlog:missionFor pcl:Backlog ;
    backlog:missionSource "Owner, 2026-10-28 and 2026-11-02: the conditions for course HTML pages (menu and tabs, left tree and tabs kept in step, code that really runs, text-size control, adaptive to any device, diagram zoom and full-screen, default text not small); 'Which RDODI profiles are existing and which interactive page templates are matching, and are they satisfying the conditions of that profile?'; 'use [the course page] or enhance the current template'; and, on the gap analysis (RDODI_PROFILE_AND_PAGE_GAPS_v1_0_0.md): 'OK, recommendations are rational. Proceed.'"^^xsd:string ;
    backlog:outcomeRationale "Replaced on the Owner's decision of 2026-11-04: the mission was not set properly. See the closure report." ;
    rdfs:comment "DRAFT by an assistant session; the Owner accepted the recommendation of 2026-11-02 (the gap analysis, section E); not owner-worded (Lineage Operating Discipline: session-drafted)."^^xsd:string,
        "Replaced on 2026-11-04 by Mission 2: it was not set properly (it left out the default page format and treated the course page as the page to prove). Kept as the record of what was believed." .

